As a refresher, the HomeView features a 7-inch square display connected to an aluminum speaker base by a stainless steel tilting hinge. Apple says it is ideal for a kitchen counter, nightstand, or side table. You can use the device to interact with Siri AI, control smart home accessories, go on FaceTime video calls, listen to music, and more.<br/>
<br/>
